--   - `DefiniteCharge`: PDF p.9: an arbitrary normalized on-site state supported in one actually occurring charge.
--   - `appendAncilla`: PDF pp.9-10: system tensor ancilla, the ancilla is the final wire.
--   - `ImplementsWithAncilla`: PDF pp.9-10: exact returned-ancilla implementation, uniformly for every system vector.
--   - `divideByOnsiteCharacter`: PDF p.20: divide by an actually occurring on-site character; invariant operators are unchanged.
--   - `characterProducts`: PDF p.20: pointwise products of two finite sets of complete characters.
--   - `parityZ`: PDF p.9 Eq.(22): tensor-product Pauli Z, with its standard computational-basis sign.
--   - `parityDet`: PDF p.9 Eq.(23): determinant on the entire even or odd physical sector.
--   - `controlGroup`: PDF pp.4,11: exact control by finite concatenations of local symmetric Hamiltonian pulses.
